%% Blockchain Event Model
flowchart LR
App[Application decision] --> E1[LOAN_APPROVED or LOAN_REJECTED]
Disb[Disbursement] --> E2[LOAN_DISBURSED]
Pay[Repayment] --> E3[REPAYMENT_RECORDED]
Zero[Balance reaches zero] --> E4[LOAN_COMPLETED]
E1-->Store[(Contract event log)]
E2-->Store
E3-->Store
E4-->Store
Store-->Query[Filter by opaque loan ID; return event + tx hash]
